      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Published alignment: CE/NE.</p><h2>Description</h2><p>This hatchling dragon's scales are a frosty white. Its head is crowned with slender horns, with a thin membrane stretched between them.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 17, touch 15, flat-footed 14 (+3 dex, +2 natural, +2 size)</p><p>hp 25 [42] (3d12+6)</p><p>Fort +5, Ref +6, Will +3</p><p>Immune Ice, Paralysis, Sleep; Resist Wind 50%</p><p>Weakness Fire</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 100 ft. (average), swim 60 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +5 (1d4), 2 Claws +5 (1d3)</p><p>Space 2.5 ft.; Reach 0 ft. (5 ft. with bite)</p><p>Special Attacks Breath Weapon (15-ft. cone, 1d10 ice damage, Reflex DC 13 half, usable every 1d4 rounds), Frostbolt</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 10, Dex 16, Con 15, Int 8, Wis 10, Cha 8</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +4; CMD 14 (18 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Alertness, Improved Initiative</p><p>Skills Fly +13, Intimidate +5, Perception +10, Stealth +11, Swim +12; Racial Modifiers +8 Swim</p><p>Languages Draconic</p><p>SQ Icewalking</p>"
      }
